      "source_xml_line": 179,
      "string_id": "merc_conteiner_dialog_phrase_15",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "If you don't want to do it, I'll go to a mechanic I know and he'll open it for me.",
      "JA_current": "If you don't want to do it, I'll go to a mechanic I know and he'll open it for me.",
      "JA_new": "それが嫌なら、知り合いのメカニックに頼んで開けてもらうさ。",
